    description: "Repro: both layout forms -> no symbol; a call to MyFn goes to a different function myfn. Also dead code: _make_edge_id / hashlib (~34, 71-74).\n\nFound by the 2026-10-10 docstring-staleness audit (reviewer + default-REJECT verifier, reproduced). Notebook: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10102026.md."  # 37fc
